{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
I am forgot[F/A]ten out of [Gm]mind like the dead
[Eb]Broken vessel cast a[Bb]way on the [F]street
[Bb]Whispering [F/A]of many sur[Gm]rounds me in fear
They [Eb]conspire against [F]me and [Bb]plot to kill
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
But [F/A]I [Gm]trust in [Dm]you LORD [Eb]I say you are my [Bb]God
[F/A]My [Gm]times are in [Dm]your hand [Eb]deliver [Bb]me [F/A]now
[Gm]Save me from [Dm]the grip [Eb]of those who [Bb]pur[F/A]sue
[Gm]Let your face [F]shine upon your [Eb]servant true
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Bb]Terror surrounds [F/A]me as they [Gm]plot my end
[Eb]I hear the voices of the [Bb]crowd
[Gm]They speak with pride [F]and arro[Eb]gance
